WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.201
Welcome to Homecare.

00:00:02.151 --> 00:00:08.558
This is your dedicated home-care research website, with its own merchant catalog and
white-label recommendations.

00:00:08.558 --> 00:00:12.332
Here’s how to move from a product search to a useful shortlist.

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:16.165
Start with Browse competitors under Products.

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:20.034
Choose the retailer first, then enter a brand or product.

00:00:20.034 --> 00:00:23.579
Category and brand filters help narrow the results.

00:00:23.579 --> 00:00:27.462
Here, Walmart and Tide bring the matching listings into view.

00:00:27.462 --> 00:00:30.502
Use Details to check the saved evidence.

00:00:31.017 --> 00:00:34.873
Select the products you want, then choose Compare selected.

00:00:34.823 --> 00:00:40.376
The table brings their photographs, pack descriptions, price observations and sources
together.

00:00:40.376 --> 00:00:43.525
Check pack sizes before comparing prices.

00:00:43.525 --> 00:00:48.140
Export selected CSV saves your shortlist with photo and source links.

00:00:48.683 --> 00:00:52.179
Homecare also keeps White-label recommendations.

00:00:52.129 --> 00:00:57.838
Choose a platform or search for a direction, then review the reference products and
proposed improvements.

00:00:57.838 --> 00:01:03.018
These are research recommendations with questions to validate, not confirmed market
gaps.

00:01:03.558 --> 00:01:07.835
Open News and updates for dated developments and new catalog additions.

00:01:07.785 --> 00:01:11.704
An added record is not automatically a new product launch.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:16.559
Use Global retailers and items to explore other countries, including China.

00:01:16.559 --> 00:01:21.127
Your research, comparison and recommendations all stay here in Homecare.
